            promptText: >-
              ## Task: digest the XP macro research for this month's client
              letters


              This digest is produced once per month and reused for every
              client, so keep it factual and client-agnostic.


              Extract from the report below:

              - the report date and title;

              - the key projections (Selic, IPCA, GDP, exchange rate, fiscal),
              with the numbers copied exactly as written in the report;

              - the main risks and the overall market sentiment;

              - the implications for each asset class (post-fixed income,
              inflation-linked bonds, credit, multimarket funds, Brazilian
              equities, international), as stated or clearly implied by the
              report;

              - which equity sectors the report sees as more exposed or more
              resilient.


              Return JSON with this schema:

              {
                "report_date": "string",
                "report_title": "string",
                "projections": [{"indicator": "string", "value": "string", "horizon": "string"}],
                "sentiment": "string (one sentence)",
                "risks": ["string"],
                "asset_class_implications": [{"asset_class": "string", "view": "favorable|neutral|unfavorable", "why": "string"}],
